From 6c468d6bc08f26c19321a7c4c3faeda71897cace Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tao Xiaobai <1599170798@qq.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 15:16:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Little Craft Launcher: report a cancelled preparation
 only after it stopped

Leaving the preparation screen reported "cancelled" at once while the
preparation task kept downloading and unpacking, so the host accepted a retry
that worked on the same Java runtime archive, runtime directory and library
part files.

- LclPreparation: one preparation per process; leaving only requests
  cancellation, the work checks it between steps and inside its own library
  download, and "cancelled" is reported when the work has really stopped. A
  start that arrives meanwhile is refused without running and without ending
  the session the old work still owns.
- Regression: preparation blocked in a download, leave, retry at once.
